WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.890 --> 00:00:04.780
Hello there.

00:00:04.780 --> 00:00:06.270
Oh, it's hot.

00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:07.120
It is warm, yeah.

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:07.953
Now,

00:00:07.953 --> 00:00:09.070
we did this in Alabama

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:11.400
with tiny, little pots of paint

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:12.800
at very high frame rates.

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:13.633
Now we're gonna

00:00:13.633 --> 00:00:14.630
step up the size.

00:00:14.630 --> 00:00:15.620
We've got bigger bangers.

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:16.453
You've got some there?

00:00:16.453 --> 00:00:17.533
Yeah

00:00:17.533 --> 00:00:18.516
Yeah, these are about

00:00:18.516 --> 00:00:19.349
five times the size

00:00:19.349 --> 00:00:20.182
So, on that one,

00:00:20.182 --> 00:00:21.015
I was sort like, stood there,

00:00:21.015 --> 00:00:21.848
didn't really care that much.

00:00:21.848 --> 00:00:23.070
Do you still have your
paint splats from Alabama?

00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:24.370
Oh yeah.

00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:25.780
Still has Alabama splats.

00:00:25.780 --> 00:00:26.970
I'll tell you what though,

00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:28.610
I am not standing anywhere near these.

00:00:28.610 --> 00:00:30.100
There are some of these
videos where it's like,

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:31.920
yeah, whatever, boo.

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:33.473
I'm scared of this one,
I'm actually worried.

00:00:33.473 --> 00:00:36.200
I think the glass is going
to go flying everywhere.

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:37.520
This is not a good idea,

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:38.670
so don't do it.

00:00:38.670 --> 00:00:40.220
You might want to protect
your eyes as well,

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:42.149
some paint may hit the lens.

00:00:42.149 --> 00:00:42.982
All right.

00:00:42.982 --> 00:00:43.860
Try and get them

00:00:43.860 --> 00:00:45.620
as close together as possible,

00:00:45.620 --> 00:00:47.060
K?

00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:47.893
And then,

00:00:47.893 --> 00:00:48.726
don't pussy out.

00:00:48.726 --> 00:00:49.559
Literally,

00:00:49.559 --> 00:00:51.029
you got time, okay?

00:00:51.029 --> 00:00:51.862
Yeah

00:00:51.862 --> 00:00:53.030
Plunge it in properly,

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:53.910
and then run.

00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:54.743
Are you ready?

00:00:54.743 --> 00:00:55.576
Yeah.

00:00:55.576 --> 00:00:56.409
So start here,

00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:59.237
three, two, one, light.

00:02:00.964 --> 00:02:02.872
What happened?

00:02:02.872 --> 00:02:05.455
One of them I couldn't light.

00:02:16.804 --> 00:02:17.670
I'm bleeding out my finger now

00:02:18.987 --> 00:02:20.623
Oh yeah. Let's get a
close up of the blood.

00:02:21.980 --> 00:02:22.813
Lovely.

00:02:22.813 --> 00:02:24.170
That is urinating blood.

00:02:24.170 --> 00:02:25.180
It's going pretty deep.

00:02:25.180 --> 00:02:26.820
I think there's glass still in there.

00:02:26.820 --> 00:02:28.756
Alright. Judging by the blood.

00:02:28.756 --> 00:02:30.303
Message to the audience?

00:02:30.303 --> 00:02:31.233
Don't do that at home.

00:02:31.233 --> 00:02:32.066
Oh yeah.

00:02:37.950 --> 00:02:39.300
I was really close to it.

00:02:47.475 --> 00:02:50.110
Is that the most severe
injury we've had so far?

00:02:50.110 --> 00:02:51.210
I got burned before,

00:02:55.120 --> 00:02:57.040
but that was probably
the most out of control.

00:02:57.040 --> 00:02:57.873
Didn't know what was

00:02:57.873 --> 00:02:58.769
going to happen one.

00:02:58.769 --> 00:02:59.602
Yeah.

00:02:59.602 --> 00:03:01.110
That's the scariest one we've ever done.

00:03:01.110 --> 00:03:02.201
Do you have any scissors?

00:03:02.201 --> 00:03:03.173
Yeah.

00:03:04.480 --> 00:03:06.160
It feels really weak.

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:07.460
It's bleeding through the
plaster and the thick bandages.

00:03:07.460 --> 00:03:08.680
I wonder if there's glass
really still in there.

00:03:08.680 --> 00:03:10.230
Still really hurts though.

00:03:10.230 --> 00:03:13.340
Let's look at your actual blood.

00:03:13.340 --> 00:03:15.580
It looks like all the other
stains on your lab coat,

00:03:15.580 --> 00:03:18.520
but it's actually your
real human blood there.

00:03:18.520 --> 00:03:19.667
Alright,

00:03:19.667 --> 00:03:20.500
what are we doing now?

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:21.333
I'm going to mix

00:03:21.333 --> 00:03:22.498
two colors of paint

00:03:22.498 --> 00:03:23.331
in each pot

00:03:23.331 --> 00:03:24.620
and then get two bangers

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:25.453
on a stick.

00:03:25.453 --> 00:03:26.286
Each one.

00:03:26.286 --> 00:03:27.119
Dip them as deep

00:03:27.119 --> 00:03:27.952
into the pot as I can.

00:03:27.952 --> 00:03:29.620
And just sort of take it.

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:30.540
You're going to sit in between them?

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:31.373
Yeah

00:03:31.373 --> 00:03:33.130
Do you reckon you'll flinch?

00:03:33.130 --> 00:03:33.963
Probably.

00:03:34.864 --> 00:03:37.373
All right. This one is
called the lab coat ruiner.

00:05:01.764 --> 00:05:02.597
Aw, man

00:05:02.597 --> 00:05:03.880
it's right on the lens.

00:05:03.880 --> 00:05:04.713
God's sake.

00:05:06.601 --> 00:05:07.460
There's as a splotch

00:05:07.460 --> 00:05:09.245
directly in the middle.

00:05:09.245 --> 00:05:10.820
It's all over my face.

00:05:10.820 --> 00:05:12.480
I can't wipe it anywhere.

00:05:12.480 --> 00:05:13.313
Where can I wipe it?

00:05:13.313 --> 00:05:14.146
Hang on.

00:05:14.146 --> 00:05:16.230
That ring just hanging in the tree there.

00:05:23.285 --> 00:05:24.640
Remains.

00:05:24.640 --> 00:05:25.590
You look good.

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:28.650
Let's have a run through
of what we've achieved in

00:05:28.650 --> 00:05:29.483
Banger week.

00:05:29.483 --> 00:05:30.390
Well, the damage this week, to me,

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:31.223
to start with

00:05:31.223 --> 00:05:32.840
is, uh, my fingers been

00:05:32.840 --> 00:05:34.282
basically blown off.

00:05:34.282 --> 00:05:35.115
It really hurts

00:05:35.115 --> 00:05:35.948
Legos.

00:05:35.948 --> 00:05:37.390
Spare bangers.

00:05:37.390 --> 00:05:38.223
Glass.

00:05:38.223 --> 00:05:39.056
Plastic.

00:05:40.301 --> 00:05:41.134
Clothing.

00:05:41.134 --> 00:05:43.090
I should not have stepped on this.

00:05:43.090 --> 00:05:43.923
That is.

00:05:45.420 --> 00:05:46.253
All right.

00:05:46.253 --> 00:05:47.930
Well, after we got done
filming that video,

00:05:47.930 --> 00:05:49.620
Dan who's in the British army,

00:05:49.620 --> 00:05:51.490
went on tour to Afghanistan.

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:53.380
And after about a month of being there

00:05:53.380 --> 00:05:55.090
his fingers still hurt.

00:05:55.090 --> 00:05:57.500
He had this weird lump over
the side of his knuckle,

00:05:57.500 --> 00:05:58.333
that wouldn't heal.

00:05:58.333 --> 00:05:59.810
So, we got an X Ray

00:05:59.810 --> 00:06:00.880
and it turned out that

00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:01.830
he did indeed have

00:06:01.830 --> 00:06:03.240
a chunk of glass

00:06:03.240 --> 00:06:05.050
lodged against his knuckle.

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:07.160
That is disgusting.

00:06:07.160 --> 00:06:08.800
So, they took it out for him.

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:10.640
And now he's got a couple of
stitches in the side of his

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:11.473
finger.

00:06:11.473 --> 00:06:12.690
So he's all fixed.

00:06:12.690 --> 00:06:14.460
So, moral of the story is,

00:06:14.460 --> 00:06:16.070
don't put a banger in a glass jar

00:06:16.070 --> 00:06:17.140
and be less than a foot away

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:18.450
from it when it goes off.

00:06:18.450 --> 00:06:19.700
Cause it's really dumb.

00:06:19.700 --> 00:06:21.110
You get molded. All right.

00:06:21.110 --> 00:06:22.600
I hope you enjoyed banger week.

00:06:22.600 --> 00:06:26.130
